cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fishbonett: Tensor-network dynamics of vibronic open quantum systems"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for tensor-network simulations of open quantum systems coupled
  to harmonic baths. It supports matrix-product-state and tree tensor network
  geometries, multiple Hamiltonian representations, and TEBD, Trotter-MPO, and
  TDVP integrators.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nuomin
    given-names: Hanggai
    email: hanggai@caltech.edu
    affiliation: California Institute of Technology
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nominhanggai/fishbone-tensor-networks"
keywords:
  - tensor networks
  - matrix product states
  - open quantum systems
  - spin-boson model
  - TEDOPA
  - electron transfer
  - vibronic dynamics
